/**
 * The `background-attachment` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets
 * whether a background image's position is fixed within the `viewport`, or scrolls with its
 * containing block.
 *
 * Initial: scroll. Inherited: no.
 * Percentages: not accepted.
 *
 * Grammar: <attachment>#
 *
 * Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-backgrounds-4/#propdef-background-attachment
 *
 * Author guide:
